{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47251","headline":"洗心 · 司马退之","name":"洗心","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不践名利道，始觉尘土腥。\n不味稻粱食，始觉精神清。\n罗浮奔走外，日月无短明。\n山瘦松亦劲，鹤老飞更轻。\n逍遥此中客，翠发皆长生。\n草木多古色，鸡犬无新声。\n君有出俗志，不贪英雄名。\n傲然脱冠带，改换人间情。\n去矣丹霄路，向晓云冥冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马退之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}